    "body": "- Move `struct NAT` from `toxcore/DHT.h` to `toxcore/DHT.c` to improve encapsulation.\r\n- Add `tcp_packet_type_to_string` and `tcp_packet_from_int` to `toxcore/TCP_common` for better debug logs.\r\n- Add `net_family_to_string` to `toxcore/net` for the same reason.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2986)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
